sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant C as Client
    participant GW as Enqueue gateway
    participant S as State store
    participant K as Kafka
    participant W as Worker
    participant DLQ as Dead-letter queue
    C->>GW: submit task with idempotency key
    GW->>S: claim key
    alt key already seen
        S-->>GW: existing task id
        GW-->>C: same id, no duplicate work
    else new
        GW->>K: produce task
        GW-->>C: task id
    end
    K->>W: lease task
    W->>S: mark running, start heartbeat
    alt succeeds
        W->>S: mark done
    else fails, attempts remain
        W->>K: requeue with backoff
    else attempts exhausted
        W->>DLQ: park for inspection
    end
    Note over W,S: a lease that stops heartbeating is redelivered
